        voronoi.GenerateVoronoi(sites, boundary);
        voronoi.ClipEdges(boundary);

        // Create a form to visualize the Voronoi diagram
        // ...
    }
}
```

### Conclusion
This is a high-level overview and a starting point for implementing Fortune's Voronoi diagram with boundary clipping in C#. The actual implementation of Fortune's algorithm and edge clipping will require more detailed coding and testing. You may want to look for existing libraries or resources that can help you with the Voronoi diagram generation if you need a more robust solution.

